\n" [:p {} "In Tokyo, his lack of major international competition did not hinder Orta, who comfortably handled Fumita in the final, winning on points, 5-1. Yemelin did win a bronze medal, winning his repêchage final easily over Moldovan " [:a {:href "/athletes/145219"} "Victor Ciobanu"] ", by technical superiority. The other bronze went to " [:a {:href "/athletes/141894"} "Walihan Sailike"] ", a Chinese wrestler of Kazakh ethnicity."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Fall", :class "footnote"} "VF"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Technical Superiority", :class "footnote"} "ST"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points", :class "footnote"} "TP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points Received", :class "footnote"} "TPR"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/142040"} "Luis Alberto Orta"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CUB"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CUB.png"}] "CUB"]] [:td {} "13"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "25"] [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/144746"} "Kenichiro Fumita"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} "11"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "15"] [:td {} "7"] [:td {} [:span {:c